			description: [
				"The airship is a fairly simple vehicle. Opening its inventory, you'll see a slot on the left for fuel. You'll also see some for various upgrades, but they'll have their own moment. For now, just know that fuel can be anything you can use in a furnace."
				"Controlling the ship is simple. Holding space raises you into the air, while shift lowers you. To leave, use the assinged keybind (Default R). Holding A or D turn left and right respectively."
